 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Qui» (subject)",
     "texto": [
      "**Qui** replaces the subject of the second sentence. It goes before the verb: **Le garçon qui parle est mon voisin** (the boy who is talking is my neighbor).",
      "Careful: you don't say **le garçon qui je parle** with the same meaning."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Que» (object)",
     "texto": [
      "**Que** replaces the direct object. It goes before the subject and the verb: **Le livre que tu lis est intéressant** (the book you are reading is interesting).",
      "Compare with English: **that** covers many uses; in French you must choose. **Qui** if what follows does the action; **que** if what follows receives it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
